requirements/README.md

# --- Python artefacts ---
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
**/.eggs
**/build
**/dist
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

# --- Tests are not needed at runtime ---
**/tests
**/tests/**

# --- Local compose override ---
docker-compose.override.yml
